593 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (This casebook documents the consulting interview experiences of the students of BITS Goa. The aim of sharing these experiences is to inform students about the case interview experiences of  the past batch and to help them prepare for their placements accordingly. The experiences listed below are not necessarily the best or the only way to handle case interviews. They only serve to give students an idea of what to expect when they walk into a case interview. Every individual could have his/her unique way of tackling consulting interviews, each of which could be correct.)
/E (This casebook documents the consulting interview experiences of the students of BITS Goa. The aim of sharing these experiences is to inform students about the case interview experiences of  the past batch and to help them prepare for their placements accordingly. The experiences listed below are not necessarily the best or the only way to handle case interviews. They only serve to give students an idea of what to expect when they walk into a case interview. Every individual could have his/her unique way of tackling consulting interviews, each of which could be correct.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
594 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (This document has contributions from students who appeared for campus interviews conducted by consulting firms during the summer and the final placement process over the last year. The interview experiences have been sorted based on the type of case, consulting firm, and industry type. Special thanks to all the contributors!)
/E (This document has contributions from students who appeared for campus interviews conducted by consulting firms during the summer and the final placement process over the last year. The interview experiences have been sorted based on the type of case, consulting firm, and industry type. Special thanks to all the contributors!)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
