/ActualText (Consultant: For the short term, we can adjust our pricing, reduce the rates so that it falls within budget of tourists or target tourists from other countries who usually do not visit Switzerland. For the long term, we can increase awareness about tourism in Switzerland by partnering with international celebrities and social media influencers. This might increase our total serviceable market share by attracting more tourists to Switzerland. We can even approach the government for subsidizing flights as the entirety of the Swiss tourism industry was affected.)
