/S /P
/ActualText (Candidate: The client generates revenue through project-based contracts with their clients. They employ a time and materials billing model, with rates varying according to the complexity and expertise required for each project. An evaluation of their pricing strategy, including any discounting practices, could reveal opportunities for revenue optimization.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [4]
>>
