/S /H4
/T (You're tasked with turning around a McDonald's outlet in Connaught Place, Delhi, that's been facing recent losses. What would be your strategy to make it profitable? )
/E (You're tasked with turning around a McDonald's outlet in Connaught Place, Delhi, that's been facing recent losses. What would be your strategy to make it profitable? )
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
1443 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant- I'd start by analyzing the financial statements to understand whether the issue lies with declining revenue or increasing costs. )
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
1444 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewer- Upon examination, it seems that the revenue is indeed decreasing, while costs have remained relatively stable. What steps would you take to address the declining revenue? )
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1445 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant- In that case, I'd focus on understanding the root causes of the revenue decline. I would conduct customer surveys, analyze sales data, and assess the impact of any recent changes in the market or customer preferences.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1446 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewer - Further analysis indicates that the decline in revenue is primarily due to increased competition in the area. How would you respond to this insight? )
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1447 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant- If competition is the key issue, I would propose a multi-pronged strategy. First, we need to enhance our competitive positioning. This might involve revisiting the menu, introducing new and innovative items, or even creating exclusive offerings that set McDonald's apart. )
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1448 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewer- That sounds like a good start. How else would you tackle the competition-driven revenue decline?)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1449 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant- I would also focus on marketing and promotional activities. Leveraging digital marketing, social media, and loyalty programs can help in retaining existing customers and attracting new ones. Additionally, we could explore strategic partnerships or collaborations to enhance the brand's visibility in the face of increased competition. )
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
