1625 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant: We can take the number of manufacturing units in North America and divide it by the average number of aircrafts manufactured in each unit. Do we have any data regarding manufacturing units in North America?)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1626 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewer: There are 3 Boeing units and 2 Airbus units in North America. Each unit produces 20 airplanes per year.)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
1627 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant: This gives us 100 airplanes manufactured per year, but not all airplanes will pass through the quality checks.)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
