/Pg 56 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
1629 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant: Great, so that leaves us with 95 airplanes produced per year.)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [10]
>>
