2396 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewer: Do you know Monginis, the bakery chain? )
/Pg 92 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
2397 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant: Yes sir. )
/Pg 92 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
2398 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewer: So Monginis is a brand only known in the western part of India. What should be done to establish them as a player in the Southern part of India too? Come up with a strategy for the same.)
/Pg 92 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
2399 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant: I'd approach it using the 3C-1P framework. First, we need to understand the customer, competition, and company dynamics. Then, we can formulate a positioning strategy. )
/Pg 92 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
2400 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewer: Interesting approach. Could you walk me through your strategy and how you would execute it? )
/Pg 92 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
2401 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant: Certainly. I propose targeting Tier 1 cities initially and introducing complete birthday packages to attract families. Additionally, a strong social media campaign can help create brand awareness. To kickstart our presence, offering significant discounts in the beginning could attract a larger audience. )
/Pg 92 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
2402 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewer: That sounds promising. How do you plan to differentiate Monginis from existing players in the Southern market? )
/Pg 92 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
2403 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant: I believe creating a niche audience could be key. For instance, focusing on unique and customizable offerings within the birthday packages can set us apart. Also, leveraging social media influencers and local celebrities can help in building trust and credibility)
/Pg 92 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
2404 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewer: Interesting points. Now, considering your strategy, who do you think would be the target customers for Monginis in the Southern market?)
/Pg 92 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
2405 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant: Our primary target would be families in Tier 1 cities, particularly those celebrating birthdays. By offering complete and hassle-free birthday packages, we aim to become their go-to choice for celebrations. )
/Pg 92 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
2406 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (BGCC, BITS Goa)
/Pg 92 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
