/ActualText (Interviewer: Our client, a well-established e-commerce giant, is considering entering the rapidly growing market of virtual reality \(VR\) shopping experiences. They are seeking your expertise to formulate a robust market entry strategy.)
/Pg 99 0 R
/K [0]
>>
