2535 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant: To begin, I would conduct a thorough research on the VR shopping market. Do we have the market size and CAGR numbers? )
/Pg 99 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
2536 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewer: According to recent industry reports, the global VR shopping market is around $20 billion, with a projected compound annual growth rate \(CAGR\) of 30%. This growth is being driven by increasing consumer adoption of VR devices, advancements in VR technology, and growing interest in immersive shopping experiences. )
/Pg 99 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
2537 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant: Interesting figures. It's clear that VR shopping is a market with significant potential for our client. To fully grasp this opportunity, I would also analyze the current players in the VR shopping landscape, understanding their strengths, weaknesses, and market positioning. )
/Pg 99 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
2538 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewer: Absolutely. There are currently several VR shopping platforms vying for market share, each with its own unique offerings. )
/Pg 99 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
2539 0 obj
<<
