2678 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant: I would thoroughly examine each product line to identify areas that align with the evolving market trends and those that might require adjustments. This would involve assessing the sustainability, sourcing practices, and overall design aesthetic of each product. )
/Pg 106 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
2679 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewer: Excellent. Now, let's imagine that your analysis reveals a potential opportunity in the market for a new line of sustainable and locally sourced athletic wear with a vintage twist. How would you approach developing and launching this new product line? )
/Pg 106 0 R
/K [3]
>>
