2680 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant: I would start by establishing a sustainable supply chain, collaborating with suppliers who align with Nike's commitment to eco-friendly materials and local manufacturing. Simultaneously, I would assemble a team of designers to create athletic wear that seamlessly blends sustainability with the nostalgic appeal of the '90s. )
/Pg 106 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
2681 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewer: That sounds promising. How would you market this new product line to appeal to both environmentally conscious consumers and those interested in vintage fashion? )
