2764 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant: Open and transparent communication with our customers would be paramount. We would issue clear and concise statements explaining this new feature and its implications. We would also provide customers with options to adjust or disable this feature if they prefer. )
/Pg 111 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
2765 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewer: That's important. Now, envision a scenario where a group of customers forms an online community advocating for the ethical treatment of holographic pets, arguing they should not be treated solely as virtual toys. How would you address this movement? )
/Pg 111 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
2766 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Consultant: I would engage with this online community to understand their concerns and perspective and to address their ethical considerations. We could explore partnerships with animal welfare organizations to demonstrate our commitment to ethical treatment while maintaining our focus on the virtual nature of our product. )
/Pg 111 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
2767 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Interviewer: That sounds like a balanced approach. Now, imagine a competitor entering the market with holographic pets claiming not only to mirror their owner's personality but also to predict future behavior based on data analysis. How would you respond to this new competitive threat? )
/Pg 111 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
